# The release store (licence rulings of 2026-10-25): answers to my own edit and agent prompts on the Python
# standard library, llama.cpp proper (no vendor/, no build outputs) and the packages of the per-package ruling
# (MIT, BSD-2/3-Clause, Apache-2.0, PSF; table strict-sitepkgs.md), plus maths from OpenR1-Math.
# Chat from OpenAssistant oasst2 and the new code-agent answers join when they exist.
# Each entry's comment is the licence the manifest reports for its answers (the longest matching path: entry wins).
